SQLarius: Excellent work, brave apprentice! You have uncovered the hidden inventory—the Root Password USB and the CEO Keycard Clone.
MainCharacter: I see how this works.
SQLarius: This is the power of [color=cyan]Data Discovery[/color]! You forced the database to show you things it keeps hidden.
SQLarius: This is just the start. If you were asking how we got all the colomn names, this is where the SQL master comes in.
SQLarius: By using calling the SQL master gives you the entire structure of the database, and we can use it to get the information we need from the table.
SQLarius: you can call it by using UNION, selecting the specific columns we need, (name, sql) and calling the sqlite_master table.
SQLarius: Then the entire structure is shown.